      "description": {
        "fun": "Obstagoon would rather taunt you into attacking first: it crosses its arms in its signature Obstruct pose and lets out a yell loud enough to rattle the attacker's defences, then strikes back with sharp claws. With its stark black-and-white look and lolling tongue it's styled on glam rock, and one even plays in a band called the Maximizers in Sword and Shield.",
        "guide": "A Dark- and Normal-type Pokémon introduced in Generation 8, the evolution of Galarian Linoone. It is a bipedal, badger-like fighter that blocks attacks with its signature move, Obstruct. Its design draws on the European badger and glam rock.",
